    "title": "AR Tracer: Trace Drawing",
    "description": "AR Tracer: Trace Drawing is the ultimate app for all your tracing needs. With this app, you can turn any photo or sample into an outline that you can trace over, perfecting your skills and creating stunning artworks.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n1. Draw with Camera: Simply choose a sample from our library or upload your own photo from the gallery. The app will project the image onto your canvas, perfectly aligned, so you can start tracing immediately.\r\n\r\n2. Record video of drawing: Record a video of drawing and paiting process\r\n\r\n3. Various drawing templates: Lots of tracing templates: Animals, Vehicles, Nature, Food, Anime etc.\r\n\r\n4. Save and Share: Once you've finished your trace drawing, save it to your gallery or share it directly on social media. Show off your artwork to friends and family with just a few taps.\r\n\r\nAR Tracer: Trace Drawing is your ultimate app for all things tracing. Whether you're creating a detailed sketch, our app makes it easy and enjoyable. Download AR Tracer: Trace Drawing today and start bringing your drawings to life!\r\n\r\n- Experience the best in AR trace drawing with our app.\r\n- Turn photos into sketches with AR trace to sketch functionality.\r\n- Create beautiful trace drawings effortlessly.\r\n- Tracer technology ensures precision and ease in your artwork.\r\n\r\nDownload AR Tracer: Trace Drawing now and unleash your creativity!",
